[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0020","text":"！　结束了\n让我看看！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0030","text":"……好像是低烧……太好了……！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0040","text":"……嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0050","text":"那就好好补充营养\n赶紧把感冒赶跑吧！\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0060","text":"……小奈……\n谢谢你，做了这么多……\n   "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0070","text":"不用谢啦～！\n之前甜花不是也照顾了甘奈很多嘛？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0080","text":"所以，这次轮到甘奈了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0090","text":"……\n这样啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0100","text":"……嘿嘿\n打扰了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0110","text":"……小甜？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0120","text":"一起睡吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0130","text":"……小时候，我们也这样过呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0140","text":"嗯……\n感觉，好久没这样了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0150","text":"……对不起，呢……甜花，会努力的……\n明明一直想着，要变得像小甜那样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0160","text":"……甜花也发烧了嘛，\n……又交换了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0170","text":"甜花变回了甜花，\n甘奈也变回了甘奈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0180","text":"……这样啊……甜花……\n变回，甜花了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0190","text":"嗯……。但是，甘奈，\n最喜欢甜花这样的甜花了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_05_0200","text":"……最喜欢哦？"}]
